                <head>No. 981<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>On November 13–14, President Eisenhower made a State visit to Canada. Information concerning
                    preparations for the visit and a <pb facs="1023" n="2113" xml:id="pg2113"/>
                    summary of the social events and official meetings that took place is <ref
                        target="#d982"><hi rendition="#italic">infra</hi></ref>.</p>
            </div>
